  "question": {
    "text": "Normals drawn to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math> at the points where it is intersected by the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> intersected at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>. Coordinates of foot of the another normal drawn to the parabola from the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
